{"id":"1db927c3e4a86c94","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-needed-redex.md","title":"正交系统的必需红项与必需步","display":"df-needed-redex — 正交系统的必需红项与必需步","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"definition","label":"56-df-needed-redex","aliases":["56-df-needed-redex"],"display":"df-needed-redex — 正交系统的必需红项与必需步","depends_on":["[[56-df-reduction-residual-transport]]","[[56-df-labelled-reduction]]","[[56-df-normal-form]]","[[56-df-orthogonal]]","[[56-df-rewrite-step]]"],"source_section":"§9.2 Definitions 9.2.1, 9.2.3; orthogonal specialization following Proposition 9.2.2","source_printed_pages":"485–486","source_ocr_blocks":[506,507],"source_verification":"概念依据已据本地DjVu提取文本核对；本地形式表示、直接推论与例子的证据范围见Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-needed-redex"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-needed-redex</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-needed-redex — 正交系统的必需红项与必需步"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fec2299959a8e3bb\" href=\"?note=fec2299959a8e3bb\" title=\"56-df-reduction-residual-transport\">56-df-reduction-residual-transport</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"971588c26e0c9fdf\" href=\"?note=971588c26e0c9fdf\" title=\"56-df-labelled-reduction\">56-df-labelled-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e295b2b3159f2b40\" href=\"?note=e295b2b3159f2b40\" title=\"56-df-normal-form\">56-df-normal-form</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"34fb9d07dfbad48c\" href=\"?note=34fb9d07dfbad48c\" title=\"56-df-orthogonal\">56-df-orthogonal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a3b60e1e9cdeef27\" href=\"?note=a3b60e1e9cdeef27\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-step\">56-df-rewrite-step</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§9.2 Definitions 9.2.1, 9.2.3; orthogonal specialization following Proposition 9.2.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"485–486"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>506</span><span>507</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"概念依据已据本地DjVu提取文本核对；本地形式表示、直接推论与例子的证据范围见Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar}),V,T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V),R\">\\(\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar}),V,T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V),R\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\">\\(\\operatorname{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\)</span>，正交性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"34fb9d07dfbad48c\" href=\"?note=34fb9d07dfbad48c\" title=\"56-df-orthogonal\">56-df-orthogonal</a>；一步关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_R\">\\(\\to_R\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a3b60e1e9cdeef27\" href=\"?note=a3b60e1e9cdeef27\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-step\">56-df-rewrite-step</a>。</li>\n<li>带规则身份的红项集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\">\\(\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\\)</span>、具体步集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Step}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{Step}_R\\)</span>、有限路径集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_R\">\\(\\mathcal F_R\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell,\\operatorname{src},\\operatorname{tgt},\\operatorname{step}_i,\\rho|_i\">\\(\\ell,\\operatorname{src},\\operatorname{tgt},\\operatorname{step}_i,\\rho|_i\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"971588c26e0c9fdf\" href=\"?note=971588c26e0c9fdf\" title=\"56-df-labelled-reduction\">56-df-labelled-reduction</a>。</li>\n<li>沿有限路径的单个红项残余集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\rho,u)\">\\(\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\rho,u)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"fec2299959a8e3bb\" href=\"?note=fec2299959a8e3bb\" title=\"56-df-reduction-residual-transport\">56-df-reduction-residual-transport</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NF}\">\\(\\mathrm{NF}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"e295b2b3159f2b40\" href=\"?note=e295b2b3159f2b40\" title=\"56-df-normal-form\">56-df-normal-form</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Needed}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{Needed}_R\\)</span> 的局部参数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in T\">\\(s\\in T\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\">\\(u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NeededRed}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{NeededRed}_R\\)</span> 独立对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in T\">\\(s\\in T\\)</span> 定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FinNeeded}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{FinNeeded}_R\\)</span> 独立以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R\">\\(\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R\\)</span> 为局部参数。有限路径下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 取自然数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NeedRel}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{NeedRel}_R\\)</span> 的变量由其集合构造有界绑定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Needed}_R(s,u)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall\\eta\\in\\{\\zeta\\in\\mathcal F_R:\n\\operatorname{src}(\\zeta)=s\\land\n\\mathrm{NF}(T,\\to_R,\\operatorname{tgt}(\\zeta))\\}\\;\n\\exists i&lt;\\ell(\\eta)\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{step}_i(\\eta)\\in\nT\\times\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\eta|_i,u)\\times T\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Needed}_R(s,u)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall\\eta\\in\\{\\zeta\\in\\mathcal F_R:\n\\operatorname{src}(\\zeta)=s\\land\n\\mathrm{NF}(T,\\to_R,\\operatorname{tgt}(\\zeta))\\}\\;\n\\exists i&lt;\\ell(\\eta)\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{step}_i(\\eta)\\in\nT\\times\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\eta|_i,u)\\times T\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NeededRed}_R(s):=\n\\{u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s):\\operatorname{Needed}_R(s,u)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{NeededRed}_R(s):=\n\\{u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s):\\operatorname{Needed}_R(s,u)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NeedRel}_R:=\n\\{(s,u,t)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R:\\operatorname{Needed}_R(s,u)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{NeedRel}_R:=\n\\{(s,u,t)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R:\\operatorname{Needed}_R(s,u)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FinNeeded}_R(\\rho)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall i&lt;\\ell(\\rho)\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{step}_i(\\rho)\\in\\operatorname{NeedRel}_R\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FinNeeded}_R(\\rho)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall i&lt;\\ell(\\rho)\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{step}_i(\\rho)\\in\\operatorname{NeedRel}_R\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书在一般左线性背景下用“某个残余必被重叠消除”定义needed；在本节点明确限定的正交系统中，重叠消除只能是同一红项的收缩，故这里等价地要求每条通向正规形的具体归约都实际收缩该红项的某个残余。定义不能只要求最终残余为空，因为红项也可能被删除而从未收缩。没有正规形时该全称条件真空成立；本定义不额外断言任意非正规形都存在必需红项，也不由定义推出任意必需归约正规化。NeedRel保留具体步身份；FinNeeded每一步按当时的源项重新判定needed，而不是仅追踪初始项的必需集合。</p>\n<p>来源OCR块按本地提取文本的U+001F从1编号；未作机器证明或计算性断言。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-reduction-residual-transport","status":"resolved","id":"fec2299959a8e3bb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-reduction-residual-transport]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-labelled-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"971588c26e0c9fdf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-labelled-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-normal-form","status":"resolved","id":"e295b2b3159f2b40","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-normal-form]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-orthogonal","status":"resolved","id":"34fb9d07dfbad48c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-orthogonal]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-step","status":"resolved","id":"a3b60e1e9cdeef27","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-rewrite-step]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-orthogonal","status":"resolved","id":"34fb9d07dfbad48c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar}),V,T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V),R$，满足 $\\operatorname{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)$ 与 $\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,R)$，正交性见 [[56-df-orthogonal]]；一步关系 $\\to_R$ 见 [[56-df-rewrite-step]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-step","status":"resolved","id":"a3b60e1e9cdeef27","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar}),V,T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V),R$，满足 $\\operatorname{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)$ 与 $\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,R)$，正交性见 [[56-df-orthogonal]]；一步关系 $\\to_R$ 见 [[56-df-rewrite-step]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-labelled-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"971588c26e0c9fdf","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"带规则身份的红项集 $\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)$、具体步集 $\\operatorname{Step}_R$、有限路径集 $\\mathcal F_R$、$\\ell,\\operatorname{src},\\operatorname{tgt},\\operatorname{step}_i,\\rho|_i$ 见 [[56-df-labelled-reduction]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-reduction-residual-transport","status":"resolved","id":"fec2299959a8e3bb","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"沿有限路径的单个红项残余集 $\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\rho,u)$ 见 [[56-df-reduction-residual-transport]]；$\\mathrm{NF}$ 见 [[56-df-normal-form]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-normal-form","status":"resolved","id":"e295b2b3159f2b40","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"沿有限路径的单个红项残余集 $\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\rho,u)$ 见 [[56-df-reduction-residual-transport]]；$\\mathrm{NF}$ 见 [[56-df-normal-form]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar}),V,T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V),R","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\to_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Step}_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell,\\operatorname{src},\\operatorname{tgt},\\operatorname{step}_i,\\rho|_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\rho,u)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Needed}_R","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NeededRed}_R","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FinNeeded}_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NeedRel}_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Needed}_R(s,u)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall\\eta\\in\\{\\zeta\\in\\mathcal F_R:\n\\operatorname{src}(\\zeta)=s\\land\n\\mathrm{NF}(T,\\to_R,\\operatorname{tgt}(\\zeta))\\}\\;\n\\exists i<\\ell(\\eta)\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{step}_i(\\eta)\\in\nT\\times\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\eta|_i,u)\\times T\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NeededRed}_R(s):=\n\\{u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s):\\operatorname{Needed}_R(s,u)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NeedRel}_R:=\n\\{(s,u,t)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R:\\operatorname{Needed}_R(s,u)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FinNeeded}_R(\\rho)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall i<\\ell(\\rho)\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{step}_i(\\rho)\\in\\operatorname{NeedRel}_R\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":3204,"backlinks":[{"id":"e55686f28cfe7001","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 [[56-df-needed-redex]] 的正交系统，采用其中的 $\\operatorname{NeedRel}_R$。$\\operatorname{InfRed}_R,\\mathcal E_R$ 及具体路径编码沿用其上游。$\\operatorname{OccStrategy}_R$ 与 $\\mathrm{WNAt}$ 见 [[56-df-occurrence-reduction-strategy]]。$\\operatorname{InfNeeded}_R$ 与 $\\operatorname{InfHyperNeeded}_R$ 分别以 $\\boldsymbol s\\in T^{\\mathbb N}$、$\\boldsymbol u\\in\\mathcal E_R^{\\mathbb N}$ 为局部参数。$\\operatorname{NeededStrategy}_R$ 独立以 $S\\subseteq\\operatorname{Step}_R$ 为局部参数；$\\operatorname{HyperNormalizingNeeded}_R$ 中的序列由其内部量词绑定。"},{"id":"d29a2d7a5d02147b","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Orthogonal}$、$\\operatorname{Needed}_R$、$\\operatorname{Red}_R$ 与 $\\operatorname{Step}_R$ 见 [[56-df-needed-redex]]，单步残余见 [[56-df-orthogonal-residual]]，$\\mathrm{NF}$ 见 [[56-df-normal-form]]。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-192","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-needed-redex.md]]"},{"id":"b1f8b060010b2b2b","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 [[56-df-needed-redex]] 的正交系统；$\\operatorname{Needed}_R$、$\\operatorname{Red}_R$ 采用该节点的接口。"},{"id":"60cf9e66e1dc462c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[56-thm-external-redex-persistence]] 的正交系统及外部性、残余与最外位置接口；$s\\in T$、$u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)$，$\\operatorname{External}_R(s,u)$。$\\operatorname{Needed}_R(s,u)$ 见 [[56-df-needed-redex]]。"},{"id":"b27fe8e1fab5f371","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 [[56-df-needed-redex]] 的正交系统，$s\\in T$、$u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)$；$\\operatorname{Needed}_R$ 见该节点。$\\operatorname{TraceNeeded}_R(s,u)$、$\\operatorname{TN}_R$、$\\operatorname{Anc}_R$ 见 [[56-df-trace-ancestors]]。有限标准化存在性、标准步对最终项的trace与trace的置换不变性分别见 [[56-thm-finite-standardization]]、[[56-lem-standard-steps-trace-target]]、[[56-lem-trace-permutation]]；模式残余传送及消除分类见 [[56-lem-redex-pattern-static-transport]]。"},{"id":"087a1cdc8995ba56","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Red}_R$、$\\operatorname{Needed}_R$ 和具体步、有限路径、残余传送采用 [[56-df-needed-redex]] 的接口；位置序 $<_{\\mathrm{lex}}$ 沿用 [[56-df-normal-order]]。$s\\in T$ 和 $u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)$ 在第一条断言中有界量化。"}],"outgoing":["fec2299959a8e3bb","971588c26e0c9fdf","e295b2b3159f2b40","34fb9d07dfbad48c","a3b60e1e9cdeef27"]}